      "id": "claim_b0f94cf433ed4159a3805eac66b4055d",
      "statement": "The Python `patent_factory` core, rather than an agent wrapper, is the sole authority for workflow state transitions, gates, invalidation, idempotency, and exports; wrappers must not modify SQLite state or exports directly.",
