      "id": "claim_1cb0e70e530e4ebdb211c970b7f0151d",
      "statement": "The only documented opt-in networked CLI paths are `research kipris`, `audit retrieve --live`, and `research serpapi`: the KIPRIS paths send bounded query terms plus `KIPRIS_PLUS_API_KEY` to `plus.kipris.or.kr`, while SerpApi sends bounded keyword, country, and paging parameters plus `SERPAPI_API_KEY` to `serpapi.com`; other commands do not send documents, workspace, or profile data.",
